      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While we'd like to support tablets, our focus right now is on phones. I think the solution here is to only support a landscape mode on Tablets or displays of a certain ratio+density. The truth is that landscape mobile UI tends to be too squished and hard to follow. In the upcoming release, we've fixed the issue of the app *sometimes* being able to go into landscape mode on the Native UI. That said, I think it's safe to keep this as tracked as it's hard to say we'll always force portrait as we expand device support.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
